WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.136
Sometimes one line from an old entry stops you.

2
00:00:05.436 --> 00:00:10.696
Tap Mark, and that second is kept, even before you have the words.

3
00:00:11.996 --> 00:00:15.522
Or hold any line of the transcript, and choose Mark.

4
00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:23.847
A few days later, it comes back to you, at that exact second, and asks how it sits now.

5
00:00:25.147 --> 00:00:31.967
When the words come, add a thought. It sits under the line, with how long after you wrote it.

6
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:36.284
Look for Mark on the right, whenever you watch an entry.
